5,1,1,talk,Minato,,I am worried the ground will surprise us. Who knows the soil here?,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,May,,"The ribbon-cutting is cheap, but the bills come later. I need to see the long-term costs.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Shizue,,I have seen many pretty openings that faded quickly. I want to see what remains.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Victoria,,Who actually mows the grass on a Tuesday? I need to know the staffing reality.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,The park is used daily. I need to know how people actually move through it.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Minato,,"@Shunichi, do the crossing counts show where people really walk?","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,May,,"@Victoria, if the staff are gone, who pays for the extra services?","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Minato, the earth-moving firms are few. I am curious about their tenders.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Victoria,,"@May, the upkeep ledger will tell us the true price of maintenance.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Shizue, the condition of old works tells us what lasts. I agree.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Minato,,I will check the firms tendering for earth-moving.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,May,,I will look at the upkeep ledger spend per hectare.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Shizue,,I will review the condition of works from the earlier programme.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Victoria,,I will check the groundskeeping roll and bought-in services.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,I will look at the timed counts of weekday crossings.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Minato,,I will also check the depot phasing notes on hoarding.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,May,,I will also look at the terms of the regional habitat fund.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Shizue,,I will also check the record of the eastern avenue planting.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Victoria,,I will also look at the volunteer groups working with the division.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Shunichi,,I will also check the drainage callouts and August heat readings.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
