35,2,1,talk,Minato,,Only two firms can move earth here. Both flagged clay and slippage risk.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,May,,"The habitat fund pays for planting and water, but never for surfacing or buildings.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Shizue,,"The old basin is fine, but the civic hall apron has been patched three times.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Victoria,,The groundskeeping roll is down to seven. We buy in specialist care now.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Shunichi,,People cross on firm ground to the tram. Drainage callouts have doubled.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Minato,,"@May, if the fund excludes buildings, that limits what we can build.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,May,,"@Minato, exactly. Hard surfaces are out of scope for the main funding.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Shunichi, the drainage issue is serious. The heat readings were high too.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Shizue, the volunteer groups help, but they are casual. Not a full team.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Victoria, the crossing data shows people avoid soft margins. They want firm paths.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Minato,,"The phasing notes say the south can be hoarded, but the centre cannot.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,May,,The upkeep ledger shows planted ground costs triple the hard-surfaced areas.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Shizue,,The eastern avenue trees died because aftercare was missing from the contract.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Victoria,,"The volunteer groups are good for weekends, but not for daily heavy maintenance.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Shunichi,,The heat and drainage data suggest we need better water management.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Minato,,"@Shizue, the tree death is a warning. We need reliable aftercare.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,May,,"@Minato, yes. If we plant, we must budget for the triple cost.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Shizue,,"@May, the fund covers planting, but the upkeep is on us. That is heavy.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Victoria,,"@Shunichi, the drainage problem is real. We need a plan that handles water.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Shunichi,,"@Victoria, the wetland plan might solve the drainage and heat issues.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
